==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|produire}}, borrowed from {{bor|fr|la|prōdūcere|notext=1}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|prōdūcō}}, with conjugation based on verbs like {{m|fr|conduire}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-produire.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/pʁɔ.dɥiʁ/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{lb|fr|transitive}} to [[produce]], to [[yield]]
# {{lb|fr|reflexive}} to [[happen]], [[take place]] (of an event)
# {{lb|fr|reflexive}} to [[perform]] (of a singer, etc.)

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-auto}}

